[35mpostgres-db                |[0m 	**Sequence of Events**
[35mpostgres-db                |[0m 	
[35mpostgres-db                |[0m 	1. 20 June 2023 03:20 - Power grid utility outage occurred.
[35mpostgres-db                |[0m 	2. 20 June 2023 03:46 - UPS batteries depleted and FRA05 server room 2 lost power.
[35mpostgres-db                |[0m 	3. 20 June 2023 03:49 - Incident Started
[35mpostgres-db                |[0m 	4. 20 June 2023 04:12 - IBM Cloud Site Operator Engineering team began data center recovery actions.
